        "content": "## 2. Score with AI\nClaude returns a 0-100 score and a reason; the tier (hot/warm/cold) is derived in code from LEAD_HOT_SCORE and LEAD_WARM_SCORE. Invalid output never drops the lead: it is stored as 'unscored'.",
        "height": 590,
        "width": 800,
